//www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 20:06:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/billie-eilish-helps-her-brother-finneas-tie-the-knot-by-officiating-his-wedding/</guid></item><item><title>莎朗·奥斯本为之前被指控虐待的摇滚明星辩护：“他是朋友，而且永远都是朋友”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/sharon-osbourne-defends-rock-star-previously-accused-of-abuse-hes-a-friend-and-always-will-be/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;多年来，无数女性指控玛丽莲·曼森性侵，莎朗·奥斯本出面为他辩护。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/sharon-osbourne-defends-rock-star-previously-accused-of-abuse-hes-a-friend-and-always-will-be/"&gt;莎朗·奥斯本 (Sharon Osbourne) 为之前被指控虐待的摇滚明星辩护：“他是朋友，并且永远都是朋友”，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:39:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/sharon-osbourne-defends-rock-star-previously-accused-of-abuse-hes-a-friend-and-always-will-be/</guid></item><item><title>创作者泰勒反思了围绕他最具争议性的专辑的强烈反对：“我太糟糕了”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/tyler-the-creator-reflects-on-the-backlash-surrounding-his-most-divisive-album-i-got-st-on-sooooo-bad/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Tyler the Creator 回忆了人们对他 2015 年专辑《Cherry Bomb》的强烈反对，以及他现在对这张专辑成为邪教经典的感受。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/tyler-the-creator-reflects-on-the-backlash-surrounding-his-most-divisive-album-i-got-st-on-sooooo-bad/"&gt;泰勒，创作者反思了围绕他最具争议性的专辑的强烈反对：“I Got S**t on Sooooo Bad”&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 17:33:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/tyler-the-creator-reflects-on-the-backlash-surrounding-his-most-divisive-album-i-got-st-on-sooooo-bad/</guid></item></channel></rss>